                    <h3 class="news-headline">New MacBook Air brings M3 chip to the world's most popular laptop</h3>
                    <p class="news-desc">The new MacBook Air is supercharged by M3, delivering faster performance and longer battery life.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <article class="news-card">
                <div class="news-img-wrapper">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511707171634-5f897ff02aa9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="iPhone" class="news-img">
                </div>
                <div class="news-body">
                    <span class="news-tag">Environment</span>
                    <h3 class="news-headline">Apple advances progress toward 2030 climate goal with new suppliers</h3>
                    <p class="news-desc">Over 250 manufacturing partners have committed to powering all Apple production with 100% clean electricity.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

             <!-- Card 3 -->
             <article class="news-card">
                <div class="news-img-wrapper">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544866594-6eadee19205a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Vision Pro" class="news-img">
                </div>
                <div class="news-body">
