                    <h3 class="news-headline">New tools for spatial computing now available for developers</h3>
                    <p class="news-desc">Developers can build new experiences for Apple Vision Pro using updated SDKs and tools released today.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Card 4 -->
            <article class="news-card">
                <div class="news-img-wrapper">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1491975474562-1f4e30bc9468?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Music" class="news-img">
                </div>
