                    <h3 class="news-headline">Apple Music Classical expands to new regions worldwide</h3>
                    <p class="news-desc">The dedicated classical music app is now available in over 30 countries with lossless audio and hi-res audio.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

        </section>
    </main>

</body>
